ent-EldritchCardHeretic = eldritch card
    .desc = A plastic rectangle cursed with the power of keys. It remembers every door it has opened.
    .suffix = Lock
ent-LabyrinthHandbookHeretic = labyrinth handbook
    .desc = A handbook of the Locked Labyrinth's laws, penned on an unknown substance. Its pages strain against the binding, eager to lash out.
    .suffix = Lock
ent-HereticLockPortal = crack in reality
    .desc = A crack in space, impossibly deep and painful to the eyes. Definitely not safe.
ent-HereticLabyrinthBarrier = labyrinth pages
    .desc = A field of papers flying in the air, repulsing heathens with impossible force.
ent-HereticLockRift = tear in reality
    .desc = It stares back. There is no reason to remain. Run.
ent-MobHereticLockRefuge = caretaker's haze
    .desc = A barely visible outline of a human figure.
ent-MobHereticLockAscendedStalker = ascended flesh stalker
    .desc = An abomination cobbled together from varied remains. Its appearance changes slightly every time you blink.
ent-MobHereticLockAscendedProphet = ascended raw prophet
    .desc = An abomination stitched together from a few severed arms and one swollen, orphaned eye.
ent-MobHereticLockAscendedRustWalker = ascended rust walker
    .desc = A grinding, clanking construct which leaches life from its surroundings with every armoured step.
ent-MobHereticLockAscendedAshSpirit = ascended ash spirit
    .desc = A manifestation of ash, trailing a perpetual cloud of short-lived cinders.
ent-ClothingOuterArmorHereticLock = Shifting Guise
    .suffix = Lock
    .desc = A ragged, dusty set of robes. Strange eyes line the inside.
ent-ClothingHeadHatHoodHereticLock = Shifting Guise hood
    .suffix = Lock
    .desc = A torn, dust-caked hood. Strange eyes line the inside.
